<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82202" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίσσ-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίττωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is over and above</i>, esp. <i>that
				which remains after the digestion of food</i>, either as <i>a
				secretion</i> or <i>an excretion</i>, defined as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς τροφῆς ὑπόλειμμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				724b26
			</span></i>,  cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				293
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Meno
				<u>Iatr.</u>
				4.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.130a
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα δὲ [τὰ π.] ἐστὶ κόπρος, φλέγμα,
					χολή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					511b9
				</span></i>
			; also of hair and nails, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.189b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>refuse, dregs</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ π. τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cor.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
